human-run via //deploy/release:signing_demo (Sigstore keyless cosign
sign-blob --bundle plus gh attestation create on tuf-repo-cdn.sigstore.dev);
CI never signs PR code, fork-safe, publishes nothing.
Dry-run only forever is rejected, blocks Supported; checksum-only verification
is not publisher-identity proof; Compatibility: Release only.
